{"type":"message","id":"b3db2d86","parentId":"9ea53e02","timestamp":"2026-03-04T06:34:59.730Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 14:34 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## 任务: ParMETIS 算法测试\n\n### 测试目标\n验证 ParMETIS 并行网格剖分算法的正确性\n\n### 测试步骤\n\n#### Step 1: 网格剖分\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$CGNS_ROOT/lib:$METIS_ROOT/lib:$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib:$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n\n# 测试不同剖分数\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 2\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\nmpirun -n 4 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 4\n```\n\n#### Step 2: 计算流体模拟验证\n```bash\n# np=2 剖分后的并行测试\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# np=4 剖分后的并行测试  \nmpirun -n 4 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n### 验证标准\n- 剖分成功：生成 `decomposed_mesh_*.cgns` 文件\n- 模拟收敛：残差持续下降，最终收敛\n- 无崩溃/段错误\n\n### 测试矩阵\n| n_mpi | np (n_mesh) | 剖分结果 | 模拟结果 |\n|-------|-------------|----------|----------|\n| 2 | 2 | ? | ? |\n| 2 | 4 | ? | ? |\n| 4 | 4 | ? | ? |\n\n### 注意事项\n1. 每次剖分前清理旧的 `decomposed_mesh_*.cgns` 文件\n2. 记录每次测试的耗时和残差\n3. 如果失败，记录错误信息\n\n### 输出要求\n生成测试报告，包含：\n1. 每个测试用例的结果\n2. 性能数据（剖分时间、模拟时间）\n3. 问题记录（如有）"}],"timestamp":1772606099727}}
